    "independent_mechanical_validation": "python3 + tomllib re-read all 7 committed manifests and asserted, per crate: count<=5, every keyword len<=20, every keyword matches ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_+-]*$, `readme == \"README.md\"`, and `categories` ABSENT. Result: all 7 print `OK`, script prints `ALL CLEAN`. This is the check that actually earns the acceptance claim, because `cargo package` does not."
